## Architecture (Non-negotiable)

- **4-layer strict**: Handler → Orchestration → Service → Repository
- Handler NEVER calls Repository directly
- Service NEVER imports `net/http`
- Interfaces in `internal/domain/interfaces.go` — define BEFORE implementing

## Code Standards

- `zerolog` for ALL logging — no `fmt.Println`, no `log` package
- Errors: `fmt.Errorf("operation: %w", err)` — always wrap with context
- Max 300 lines per file
- UUID primary keys (`github.com/google/uuid`)
- Context propagation: `context.Context` as first parameter

## Build Gates

- `make build` MUST pass before any commit
- `make lint` MUST pass before any commit
- `make test` MUST pass before marking tasks complete

## Conventional Commits

`feat:`, `fix:`, `test:`, `refactor:`, `chore:` — no other prefixes

